<view class="page">
  <view class="title">导入校园通知</view>
  <view class="muted">文字会直接进入解析链路；PNG/PDF 会保留原始文件并交给已配置的 OCR 边界，未配置时不会伪装成解析成功。</view>
  <textarea value="{{text}}" placeholder="粘贴校园通知原文" maxlength="100000" bindinput="onInput" />
  <button class="button secondary" disabled="{{loading}}" bindtap="chooseFile">选择 PNG/PDF 文件</button>
  <view class="muted" wx:if="{{fileName}}">已选择：{{fileName}}</view>
  <button class="button" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{loading}}" bindtap="submit">开始解析</button>
  <view class="danger" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view>
  <view class="card" wx:if="{{canManual}}">
    <view class="title">解析失败后的人工建任务</view>
    <view class="muted">原文和文件仍保留在当前文档中。只有你点击确认后，才会落库为人工任务。</view>
    <input value="{{manualTitle}}" placeholder="任务标题" maxlength="500" bindinput="onManualTitle" />
    <input value="{{manualDueAt}}" placeholder="截止时间（可选，如 2099-10-04T12:00:00+08:00）" bindinput="onManualDueAt" />
    <button class="button" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{loading}}" bindtap="manualCreate">确认创建人工任务</button>
  </view>
</view>
